sequenceDiagram
    participant T as QTimer (~60 Hz)
    participant PC as PlayerController
    participant DW as DecodeWorker
    participant MD as MultiCamDecoder
    participant RL as ReviewLabelTab
    T->>PC: tick
    PC->>PC: t = t0 + speed × (now − wall0)
    PC->>DW: request(t)
    Note over DW: only the latest t<br/>is kept (coalescing)
    DW->>MD: decode_all(t)
    MD-->>DW: {i: frame}
    DW-->>RL: frames_ready(t, images)
    PC-->>RL: playhead_changed(t)
    RL->>RL: move EEG + timeline to t
